[21.214232, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2;36m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[2;36m──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[2;36m \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36mInvestigation Plan\u001b[0m\u001b[2;36m \u001b[0m\u001b[2;36m──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[2;36m─╮\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[36m1.\u001b[0m Describe the `payments-api` pods to inspect their Last State and Events for exit codes    \u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m and reasons.                                                                                     \u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[36m2.\u001b[0m Fetch logs from the previous container instance of the `payments-api` pods to capture     \u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m crash output.                                                                                    \u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[36m3.\u001b[0m Check for any relevant Warning Events in the `shop` namespace related to `payments-api`.  \u001b[2;36m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2;36m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\r\nThe \u001b[1;36;40mpayments-api\u001b[0m pods are failing due to a hardcoded failure in their container command. Here's the \r\r\ndetailed analysis:                                                                                  \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1;35mRoot Cause\u001b[0m                                                                                          \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m 1 \u001b[0m\u001b[1mCommand Hardcoded Failure\u001b[0m:                                                                       \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mThe container's command includes the following logic:                                         \r\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m   \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m          